    "own_line": true,
    "norm": "Tests {@link EnumUtils#generateBitVector(Class, Enum...)} when called with a varargs array of enum constants. <p>{@code generateBitVector} encodes a set of enum constants into a single {@code long}, where each constant contributes the bit {@code 1L << ordinal()}. The expected values below are therefore the bitwise OR of those per-constant bits. For {@code Traffic}: RED = ordinal 0 = bit 1, AMBER = ordinal 1 = bit 2, GREEN = ordinal 2 = bit 4.</p>"
